{
  "_comment": "This file is generated. Please edit .homeycompose/app.json instead.",
  "id": "nl.senseshare",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "compatibility": ">=12.2.0",
  "sdk": 3,
  "platforms": [
    "local"
  ],
  "name": {
    "en": "SenseShare",
    "nl": "SenseShare"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Put your neighbourhood on the map with the sensors you already have",
    "nl": "Zet je buurt op de kaart met de sensoren die je al hebt"
  },
  "category": "tools",
  "tags": {
    "en": [
      "opensensemap",
      "sensebox",
      "open data",
      "citizen science",
      "air quality",
      "weather",
      "temperature",
      "upload"
    ],
    "nl": [
      "opensensemap",
      "sensebox",
      "open data",
      "burgerwetenschap",
      "luchtkwaliteit",
      "weer",
      "temperatuur",
      "upload"
    ]
  },
  "permissions": [
    "homey:manager:api"
  ],
  "images": {
    "small": "/assets/images/small.png",
    "large": "/assets/images/large.png",
    "xlarge": "/assets/images/xlarge.png"
  },
  "author": {
    "name": "Jan-kees de Rijke"
  },
  "brandColor": "#2F7D5B",
  "flow": {
    "triggers": [
      {
        "id": "upload_failed",
        "title": {
          "en": "Upload failed",
          "nl": "Upload mislukt"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Fires when an upload to openSenseMap failed, after any retries.",
          "nl": "Gaat af als een upload naar openSenseMap is mislukt, na eventuele nieuwe pogingen."
        },
        "tokens": [
          {
            "name": "error",
            "type": "string",
            "title": {
              "en": "Error message",
              "nl": "Foutmelding"
            },
            "example": {
              "en": "openSenseMap is not reachable.",
              "nl": "openSenseMap is niet bereikbaar."
            }
          }
        ],
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "device",
            "name": "device",
            "filter": "driver_id=sensebox"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      {
        "id": "upload_now",
        "title": {
          "en": "Upload to openSenseMap now",
          "nl": "Upload nu naar openSenseMap"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Sends the current readings of all linked sensors right away.",
          "nl": "Verstuurt de actuele metingen van alle gekoppelde sensoren meteen."
        },
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "device",
            "name": "device",
            "filter": "driver_id=sensebox"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "send_value",
        "title": {
          "en": "Send value to sensor",
          "nl": "Stuur waarde naar sensor"
        },
        "titleFormatted": {
          "en": "Send value [[value]] to sensor [[sensor]]",
          "nl": "Stuur waarde [[value]] naar sensor [[sensor]]"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Sends any number, for example a Logic variable, as a measurement of the chosen sensor, timestamped now.",
          "nl": "Verstuurt een willekeurig getal, bijvoorbeeld een Logica-variabele, als meting van de gekozen sensor, met het huidige tijdstip."
        },
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "device",
            "name": "device",
            "filter": "driver_id=sensebox"
          },
          {
            "name": "value",
            "type": "number",
            "title": {
              "en": "Value",
              "nl": "Waarde"
            },
            "placeholder": {
              "en": "21.5",
              "nl": "21,5"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sensor",
            "type": "autocomplete",
            "title": {
              "en": "Sensor",
              "nl": "Sensor"
            },
            "placeholder": {
              "en": "Choose a sensor of the senseBox",
              "nl": "Kies een sensor van de senseBox"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "drivers": [
    {
      "name": {
        "en": "senseBox",
        "nl": "senseBox"
      },
      "class": "sensor",
      "capabilities": [
        "last_upload",
        "upload_failures"
      ],
      "platforms": [
        "local"
      ],
      "connectivity": [
        "cloud"
      ],
      "images": {
        "small": "/drivers/sensebox/assets/images/small.png",
        "large": "/drivers/sensebox/assets/images/large.png",
        "xlarge": "/drivers/sensebox/assets/images/xlarge.png"
      },
      "pair": [
        {
          "id": "login_credentials",
          "template": "login_credentials",
          "options": {
            "title": {
              "en": "Sign in to openSenseMap",
              "nl": "Inloggen bij openSenseMap"
            },
            "usernameLabel": {
              "en": "E-mail address or user name",
              "nl": "E-mailadres of gebruikersnaam"
            },
            "usernamePlaceholder": {
              "en": "you@example.com",
              "nl": "jij@voorbeeld.nl"
            },
            "passwordLabel": {
              "en": "Password",
              "nl": "Wachtwoord"
            },
            "passwordPlaceholder": {
              "en": "Password",
              "nl": "Wachtwoord"
            }
          },
          "navigation": {
            "next": "list_devices"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "list_devices",
          "template": "list_devices",
          "navigation": {
            "prev": "login_credentials",
            "next": "koppelen"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "koppelen",
          "navigation": {
            "prev": "list_devices"
          }
        }
      ],
      "repair": [
        {
          "id": "koppelen"
        },
        {
          "id": "login_credentials",
          "template": "login_credentials",
          "options": {
            "title": {
              "en": "Sign in to openSenseMap again",
              "nl": "Opnieuw inloggen bij openSenseMap"
            },
            "usernameLabel": {
              "en": "E-mail address or user name",
              "nl": "E-mailadres of gebruikersnaam"
            },
            "usernamePlaceholder": {
              "en": "you@example.com",
              "nl": "jij@voorbeeld.nl"
            },
            "passwordLabel": {
              "en": "Password",
              "nl": "Wachtwoord"
            },
            "passwordPlaceholder": {
              "en": "Password",
              "nl": "Wachtwoord"
            }
          },
          "navigation": {
            "next": "koppelen"
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "sensebox",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "group",
          "label": {
            "en": "Upload",
            "nl": "Uploaden"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "upload_enabled",
              "type": "checkbox",
              "value": true,
              "label": {
                "en": "Upload automatically",
                "nl": "Automatisch uploaden"
              },
              "hint": {
                "en": "When off, nothing is sent on the interval. The Flow cards \"Upload now\" and \"Send value\" keep working.",
                "nl": "Als dit uit staat, wordt er niets per interval verstuurd. De Flow-kaarten \"Upload nu\" en \"Stuur waarde\" blijven werken."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "upload_interval",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 5,
              "min": 1,
              "max": 1440,
              "step": 1,
              "units": {
                "en": "min",
                "nl": "min"
              },
              "label": {
                "en": "Upload interval",
                "nl": "Uploadinterval"
              },
              "hint": {
                "en": "How often the current readings are sent (minimum 1 minute). Do not choose a shorter interval than your sensors measure: a weather station that measures every 5 minutes would otherwise send the same reading several times, and the graph looks more precise than it is.",
                "nl": "Hoe vaak de actuele metingen worden verstuurd (minimaal 1 minuut). Kies geen korter interval dan je sensoren meten: een weerstation dat elke 5 minuten meet, stuurt anders meerdere keren dezelfde meting en de grafiek lijkt nauwkeuriger dan hij is."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "upload_unchanged",
              "type": "checkbox",
              "value": true,
              "label": {
                "en": "Also send unchanged readings",
                "nl": "Ook onveranderde waarden versturen"
              },
              "hint": {
                "en": "Sends the current value of every linked sensor on each upload, also when it did not change. The graph on openSenseMap then gets one point per interval, like a senseBox with its own firmware. A value is not repeated when the Homey device is unavailable or has reported nothing for an hour. When off, only new readings are sent.",
                "nl": "Stuurt bij elke upload de actuele waarde van elke gekoppelde sensor, ook als die niet is veranderd. De grafiek op openSenseMap krijgt zo een punt per interval, zoals bij een senseBox met eigen firmware. Een waarde wordt niet herhaald als het Homey-apparaat niet beschikbaar is of al een uur niets heeft gemeld. Uit: alleen nieuwe metingen versturen."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "group",
          "label": {
            "en": "openSenseMap",
            "nl": "openSenseMap"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "box_id",
              "type": "label",
              "value": "",
              "label": {
                "en": "senseBox ID",
                "nl": "senseBox-ID"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "account",
              "type": "label",
              "value": "",
              "label": {
                "en": "Account",
                "nl": "Account"
              },
              "hint": {
                "en": "To sign in again, change the links or reload the sensor list, open this device and choose Repair.",
                "nl": "Om opnieuw in te loggen, de koppelingen te wijzigen of de sensorlijst opnieuw op te halen: open dit apparaat en kies Repareren."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": {
    "last_upload": {
      "type": "string",
      "title": {
        "en": "Last upload",
        "nl": "Laatste upload"
      },
      "getable": true,
      "setable": false,
      "uiComponent": "sensor",
      "icon": "/assets/capabilities/last_upload.svg",
      "insights": false
    },
    "upload_failures": {
      "type": "number",
      "title": {
        "en": "Failed uploads",
        "nl": "Mislukte uploads"
      },
      "getable": true,
      "setable": false,
      "uiComponent": "sensor",
      "decimals": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "icon": "/assets/capabilities/upload_failures.svg",
      "insights": true
    }
  }
}